# Generic Files & Folders

## Compiled source, build outputs
dist/
build/
out/
bin/

## Dependencies
node_modules/
vendor/
venv/
env/

## IDE/Editor directories
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

## OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

## Log files
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

## Environment variables (NEVER commit these)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
!*.env.example
!*.env.production

## Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
.claude/


